<!--
  Deck's sitemap.

  Deck's documentation is one page, so this file has one meaningful entry. That
  is an honest reflection of the site, not an oversight: a sitemap listing
  fragment URLs such as /deck#charts would be ignored, because a fragment is not
  a separate URL to a crawler. Splitting the documentation into a page per topic
  is what would make this file longer, and would also be what lets those topics
  rank on their own.

  The URLs below use the canonical base from package.json. If you deploy Deck
  somewhere else, rewrite them: a sitemap may only list URLs on the same host as
  the sitemap itself.
-->
